# NAME: Direct
# FORMAT: Loon classical domain rules, no policy value in source
# Curated mainland services and selected first-party/SDK domains.
# Used by the generated Direct subscription alongside upstream China and Apple sources.
# Avoid routing an entire shared CDN, payment processor, or foreign bank group.

